<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-03T09:46:53.115Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:46:53 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant gunmen continue to target police protecting polio vaccination teams in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, killing two officers and wounding another in Mohmand, while a separate attack in Karachi killed a PIA engineer. Border clashes intensified as Pakistani forces returned fire on Afghan Taliban posts in South Waziristan after Taliban fire on Pakistani posts. Economic pressure is rising, with LPG prices surging and threatening poor commuters. Iran is planning a four-party meeting on Afghanistan in the coming months. The conflict caused 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOeTdxMC1MZndqZDFhVjBkaFJmaFBBTTR3NnhBa3p5M1VUMTNoY2Z2RUxzTTJkdmd5OWI2YW0yZlMxN2dvS0w2ejU3X19RcWtVU25YekVmaXduZDRoSUNaUTZZbkVDWDZ1MXVqUWpCcnl4NDJ4NktNZXpCN19OLVJfV1NXSE9NSmc4N3lKaTdXZ1NraWQ2cWVET3pDZW1oS18yaWw3MWpBQkpzZXVkbDNESERR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOUHFSdFVCbGVzcFY0X2IyQUdUbTVqNzZlcjVVQnBNUzJETTlSczhra1hVb3JJVVZWS2l3MXdvRE91WDU5Ui1GZUpnYzF2VVlDM0IyTnhnRFdqaWtLdG1rTkdRZkJTNDVLWUlmZzBLeWhCREhZY0tnNDFjbno1ZW5SU1F3TWUtYVZodGd6bFVhbFRDSDBfYURBYzV5NGVBWEZkWm9YZjJjNnh2Q1h0aU9Heg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNWEMzQVllYmlfU1hJZUxlUktYdnJ5T01wMnBmM245MWxGNGhTV3ZMRFgyM3dVcDhKN1dQb3c0NFVGRGQtTzJUQUNTTEJMSGk3bnN1QkltVUxVeGRqRXBoaWhLWGpYZ2xlWlNWbHlLUW05SmFfT2paU0VRUUF1QS1FdUxibGdfQ0tBU2d0Z2U0MVlRaE5PZF9uR1ZKYV9abGtmdEpFdXJkcllBRTNMblBjMw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1DcHhlOGlNX2FhNDAyZGlwSl9vZDZYVWI5NnZHWVM3N1NaT3lyT2htQ3B1MG5ncXNkTkhmUm1YRVlZbXpWODAxbg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEF